{"unit_id": "tag:006N:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。\n设<MATH_0002>是一个范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>预层（presheaf）<MATH_0003>（定义在<MATH_0004>上，取值（with values）于<MATH_0005>）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>由如下规则给出：对每个开集（open）<MATH_0006>，指定一个对象（object）<MATH_0007>，它属于<MATH_0008>；对每个包含关系（inclusion）<MATH_0009>，指定一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>，它属于<MATH_0011>，且每当<MATH_0012>时，均有<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>（所涉预层取值（of presheaves with value）于<MATH_0015>）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>由态射（morphism）<MATH_0016>给出，后者在<MATH_0017>中，且与限制（restriction）态射（morphisms）相容。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "with values", "target_term": "取值"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves with value", "target_term": "所涉预层取值"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "预层定义的底空间。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "预层取值所在的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "定义中赋予开集对象和限制态射的数据。"}, {"source_term": "with values", "target_term": "取值", "context": "指明预层的值所在的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "此处用作名词，指底空间中的开集。"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "对每个开集指定的范畴对象。"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含关系", "context": "开集之间的包含关系。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用于指定包含关系对应的态射，并用于定义预层之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves with value", "target_term": "所涉预层取值", "context": "限定态射两端的预层取值所在的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "范畴中的态射对应于开集的限制。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义要求与这些限制态射相容。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006O:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是一个范畴（category）。\n设<MATH_0003>是一个忠实（faithful）函子（functor）。\n设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>上取值（with values）于<MATH_0006>的预层（presheaf）。\n集合（sets）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0007>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>底集合预层（underlying presheaf of sets）（对应于<MATH_0008>）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "with values", "target_term": "取值"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "underlying presheaf of sets", "target_term": "底集合预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "给定预层定义于其上的空间。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "给定预层的取值范畴。"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实", "context": "描述给定函子的性质。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "用于取得底集合预层。"}, {"source_term": "with values", "target_term": "取值", "context": "指明预层的值所在的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于给定预层及其对应的集合预层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指预层的值为集合。"}, {"source_term": "underlying presheaf of sets", "target_term": "底集合预层", "context": "给出原预层所对应的底集合预层的名称。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006M:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n习惯上用同一个字母<MATH_0001>表示底集合（sets）预层（presheaf）。根据定义<REF_0001>之前的讨论，这样做是有意义的。特别地，「设<MATH_0002>」或「设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上的截面（section）」意指<MATH_0006>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n这种记法和这些定义特别适用于<TEXTITOPEN_0001>群（groups）（不必是阿贝尔的（abelian））、环（rings）、固定环（ring）上的模（modules）、固定域（field）上的向量空间（vector spaces）的预层（Presheaves）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>等，以及<TEXTITOPEN_0002>它们之间的态射（morphisms）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔的"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "Presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指底集合预层的取值。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "与原预层共用记号的底集合预层。"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "预层在指定开集上的截面。"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群", "context": "列出由这些定义涵盖的预层取值。"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔的", "context": "列出的群不必满足阿贝尔这一条件。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "列出作为预层取值的环。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "定义模时所固定的环。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "取值为固定环上的模。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "定义向量空间时所固定的域。"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "取值为固定域上的向量空间。"}, {"source_term": "Presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "统称列出的不同取值类型的预层。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指这些预层之间的态射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006P:title", "translation": "模（modules）预层（Presheaves）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "标题指明预层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "Presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "标题所述的预层。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006P:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的环（rings）预层（presheaf）。我们想定义<MATH_0003>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）在<MATH_0004>上的概念。类比定义<REF_0001>，我们很自然会想把它定义为一个集合（sets）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0005>，使得对每个开集（open）<MATH_0006>，集合（set）<MATH_0007>都带有一个<MATH_0008>-模（module）结构，并且这个结构与限制映射（restriction mappings）（<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>的）相容。不过，惯常做法是采用下面的定义，两种定义等价（equivalent）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "给定预层的取值为环。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于环预层、模预层和集合预层。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "要定义的预层取值带有模结构。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指先考虑取值为集合的预层。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "此处用作名词，模结构按开集指定。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "每个开集上被赋予模结构的集合。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "每个开集上的取值具有此结构。"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "各开集上的模结构需与之相容。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "说明两种定义之间的关系。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space），并设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的环（rings）预层（presheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>由一个阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0005>和一个集合（sets）预层之间的（of presheaves）映射（map）\n<MATH_0006>\n给出，使得对每个开集（open）<MATH_0007>，映射（map）\n<MATH_0008>\n定义了一个<MATH_0009>-模（module）结构，其所在的阿贝尔群（abelian group）为<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>（在<MATH_0012>-模（modules）预层之间（of presheaves））<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是一个阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，使得图（diagram）<MATH_0014>交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 上述<MATH_0015>-模（module）态射（morphisms）所成的集合（set）记为<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0017>-模（modules）预层（of presheaves）范畴（category）记为<MATH_0018>。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预层之间的"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预层之间"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "给定环预层所在的空间。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "给定预层的值为环。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于环预层、模预层和阿贝尔预层。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "限定所定义的预层、态射和范畴。"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "修饰给定的预层及态射两端的预层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "用于指定映射两端预层的取值。"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预层之间的", "context": "作定语，限定定义中的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指集合预层之间的映射及其在开集上的映射。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "用作名词，给出定义模结构的范围。"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "其上定义模结构的群。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "用于模结构和模态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用于模预层及其阿贝尔预层之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预层之间", "context": "指模预层态射的两端。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "与阿贝尔一词连用，指态射的两端。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "给出态射需要满足的条件。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "描述图所满足的交换性。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指组成所记集合的模态射。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "由上述态射所成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "限定所记范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指模预层及其态射构成的范畴。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006P:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上环（rings）预层（presheaves）之间的态射（morphism）。这时，若<MATH_0003>是一个<MATH_0004>-模（modules）预层（presheaf），则可将<MATH_0005>看作一个<MATH_0006>-模（modules）预层（presheaf），办法是采用复合（composition）\n<MATH_0007>\n有时我们将其记为<MATH_0008>，以表明对环（rings）的限制（restriction）。我们称之为<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0009>的限制（restriction）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。由此得到限制（restriction）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0010>\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n另一方面，给定一个<MATH_0011>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0012>，\n我们可以构造一个<MATH_0013>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0014>，\n其规则为\n<MATH_0015>\n下标（index）<MATH_0016>表示「预层（presheaf）」，而非「点（point）」。这个预层（presheaf）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>张量积预层（tensor product presheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。由此得到<TEXTITOPEN_0003>环（rings）变换（change）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>函子（functor）\n<MATH_0017>\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "index", "target_term": "下标"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "tensor product presheaf", "target_term": "张量积预层"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "change", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "用于环预层、对环的限制及环变换。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于态射两端的环预层。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定一个环预层之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "用于两种模预层。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指模预层，也用于解释下标。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "用以给出限制后的模结构。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "用于环的限制、所得预层及相应函子。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指限制及环变换所给出的函子。"}, {"source_term": "index", "target_term": "下标", "context": "指张量积预层记号中的下标。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "用于辨明所用下标的含义。"}, {"source_term": "tensor product presheaf", "target_term": "张量积预层", "context": "所得预层的名称。"}, {"source_term": "change", "target_term": "变换", "context": "与环连用，指用张量积预层实现的变换。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006R:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>如上所述，则存在一个典范（canonical）双射（bijection）\n<MATH_0006>\n换言之，限制（restriction）与环（rings）变换（change）这两个函子（functors）彼此伴随（adjoint）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "change", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "修饰引理中给出的双射。"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "引理断言存在的对应。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "两个伴随函子之一所作的操作。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "与变换连用，确定另一函子。"}, {"source_term": "change", "target_term": "变换", "context": "指通过张量积预层给出的环变换。"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "限制与环变换给出的两个函子。"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随", "context": "双射所表达的两个函子之间的关系。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006R:proof", "translation": "这是因为对于环映射（ring map）<MATH_0001>，限制（restriction）函子（functor）与环（ring）变换（change）函子（functor）彼此伴随（adjoint）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "change", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "给出证明中所用伴随关系的环映射。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "给定环映射所确定的一个函子。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "分别指限制函子与环变换函子。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "环变换一词中的环。"}, {"source_term": "change", "target_term": "变换", "context": "与环连用，确定与限制函子伴随的函子。"}, {"source_term": "adjoint", "target_term": "伴随", "context": "证明所用的两个函子之间的关系。"}], "notes": []}
